{#
Jinja2 Template for Requirements Index Generation
This template generates index.md files for requirements directories

Security: All variables are auto-escaped by Jinja2
Input validation must be performed before template rendering

Template Variables:
  - title: str - Page title (e.g., "Requirements Index" or "GenUser Requirements")
  - description: str|None - Optional page description
  - component_name: str|None - Component name for filtered views (e.g., "genuser")
  - requirements: list[dict] - List of requirement metadata dicts
  - phases: list[int] - Unique phases for filter dropdown
#}
---
hide:
  - toc
---

# {{ title | trim }}
{% if description %}

{{ description | trim }}
{% endif %}
{% if component_name %}

## About {{ component_name }} Component

This section contains requirements specific to the **{{ component_name }}** subsystem.

**Naming Convention:**

- **File name**: `req-{{ component_name | lower }}-[component-name].md`
- **req_id**: `req-{{ component_name | lower }}-[component-name]`
- **Example**: `req-{{ component_name | lower }}-plant-database.md` with `req_id: req-{{ component_name | lower }}-plant-database`

## Related Requirements

See [Main Requirements Index](../req-index.md) for all project requirements.
{% endif %}

## Requirements Table

<div class="req-index-controls" markdown="1">
  <div class="req-filters">
    <input type="text" id="req-search" placeholder="Search requirements..." />
    <select id="phase-filter">
      <option value="">All Phases</option>
{%- for phase in phases | sort %}
      <option value="{{ phase }}">Phase {{ phase }}</option>
{%- endfor %}
    </select>
    <select id="priority-filter">
      <option value="">All Priorities</option>
      <option value="CRITICAL">Critical</option>
      <option value="HIGH">High</option>
      <option value="MEDIUM">Medium</option>
      <option value="LOW">Low</option>
    </select>
  </div>
</div>

<table id="requirements-table" class="requirements-table">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th class="sortable" data-sort="priority">Priority <span class="sort-icon">⇅</span></th>
      <th class="sortable" data-sort="phase">Phase <span class="sort-icon">⇅</span></th>
      <th class="sortable" data-sort="docnum">Doc Number <span class="sort-icon">⇅</span></th>
      <th class="sortable" data-sort="title">Title <span class="sort-icon">⇅</span></th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
{%- for req in requirements %}
    <tr data-phase="{{ req.phase }}" data-priority="{{ req.priority }}" data-docnum="{{ req.doc_number }}" data-title="{{ req.title_clean }}">
      <td style="text-align: center;"><span class="priority-badge priority-{{ req.priority | lower }}">{{ req.priority }}</span></td>
      <td style="text-align: center;">{{ req.phase }}</td>
      <td style="text-align: center;">{{ req.doc_number }}</td>
      <td><a href="{{ req.file_path }}">{{ req.title_clean }}</a></td>
    </tr>
{%- endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
{% if requirements | length == 0 %}

!!! info "No Requirements Found"
    No requirements matching the filter criteria were found. Requirements will appear here once they are created.
{% endif %}
